{"id":"6c639e2083bc9b76","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-tm-accept.md","title":"Turing Machine Acceptance","display":"df-tm-accept — Turing Machine Acceptance","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-tm-accept","aliases":["88-df-tm-accept"],"display":"df-tm-accept — Turing Machine Acceptance","depends_on":["[[88-df-turing-machine]]","[[88-df-tm-initial-configuration]]","[[88-df-tm-computation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-tm-accept"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-tm-accept</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tm-accept — Turing Machine Acceptance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f8f3a8be6b88d18\" href=\"?note=3f8f3a8be6b88d18\" title=\"88-df-tm-initial-configuration\">88-df-tm-initial-configuration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25d15dae418e51ef\" href=\"?note=25d15dae418e51ef\" title=\"88-df-tm-computation\">88-df-tm-computation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> (Turing machine, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma_M^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma_M^*\\)</span> (input string)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(w)\">\\(\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(w)\\)</span> (acceptance predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Init}_M(w,C_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{Init}_M(w,C_0)\\)</span> (initial-configuration predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3f8f3a8be6b88d18\" href=\"?note=3f8f3a8be6b88d18\" title=\"88-df-tm-initial-configuration\">88-df-tm-initial-configuration</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computation}_M(C_0,\\ldots,C_n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Computation}_M(C_0,\\ldots,C_n)\\)</span> (finite computation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"25d15dae418e51ef\" href=\"?note=25d15dae418e51ef\" title=\"88-df-tm-computation\">88-df-tm-computation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M\">\\(q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M\\)</span> (accept-state projection, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}accept} \\vdash \\mathrm{Accepts}_M(w) \\leftrightarrow M\\in\\mathrm{TM} \\land \\exists n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;\\exists C_0,\\ldots,C_n\\;\\exists T\\;\\exists i\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Init}_M(w,C_0) \\land \\mathrm{Computation}_M(C_0,\\ldots,C_n) \\land C_n=\\langle q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,T,i\\rangle\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}accept} \\vdash \\mathrm{Accepts}_M(w) \\leftrightarrow M\\in\\mathrm{TM} \\land \\exists n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\;\\exists C_0,\\ldots,C_n\\;\\exists T\\;\\exists i\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Init}_M(w,C_0) \\land \\mathrm{Computation}_M(C_0,\\ldots,C_n) \\land C_n=\\langle q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,T,i\\rangle\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>接受意味着计算到达接受状态</li>\n<li>接受的输入组成机器的语言</li>\n<li>不接受的输入可能拒绝或永不终止</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-initial-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"3f8f3a8be6b88d18","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-initial-configuration]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-computation","status":"resolved","id":"25d15dae418e51ef","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$ (Turing machine, see [[88-df-turing-machine]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-initial-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"3f8f3a8be6b88d18","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Init}_M(w,C_0)$ (initial-configuration predicate, see [[88-df-tm-initial-configuration]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-computation","status":"resolved","id":"25d15dae418e51ef","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Computation}_M(C_0,\\ldots,C_n)$ (finite computation, see [[88-df-tm-computation]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M$ (accept-state projection, see [[88-df-turing-machine]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex"